<title>LATVIA: LIEPAJAS METALURGS TO JOIN BOURSE FREE LIST.</title>
<headline>LIEPAJAS METALURGS TO JOIN BOURSE FREE LIST.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock exchange on Thursday said that newly privatised metals company Liepajas Metalurgs would join the free list of the bourse from July 7.</p>
<p>The company had earlier said that it wanted to be listed on the official list of the market.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
